iwinfo: build the wl backend when kmod-brcm-wl-blob is selected

Also provide the htmode/center_chan2 operations rpcd calls unconditionally
(otherwise rpcd dereferences NULL and LuCI wireless status times out), a
real channel list (WLC_GET_VALID_CHANNELS: the stock backend asked wireless
extensions, which the driver does not have, so LuCI had no channels and
cleared band/channel/htmode on save), and the control channel, center
channel and frequency derived from the chanspec.

